   "instruction": "On sheet 요약, add a new table named Overtime whose top-left cell is G1, with four columns in this order: 지점 (text), 월 (a date, format yyyy-mm), 초과근무 (a number, format #,##0) and 1인당 (a number, format 0.0). 1인당 is a formula column: the row's 초과근무 divided by the number of rows of the table Roster whose 지점 is the row's 지점. The table has these rows, in this order: 서울본점, 2026-08, 412; 부산, 2026-08, 288; 대구, 2026-08, 305; 광주, 2026-08, 196. Change nothing else."
